BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CIS: The Best Reward
DTSTART:20251116T001500Z
DTEND:20251116T021000Z
DTSTAMP:20251116T001500Z
UID:jvepG2VqOS
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 98 mins (1h38m)\n\nCinema Italian Style Mattia is a 
 teenager from small-town Italy. Tormented by guilt over his brother’s de
 ath\, he drops out of school\, starts to work at a local factory\, and con
 verts to Islam. Will he avoid the trap of isolation and violence? Director
  Federico Ferrone scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-an
 d-events/cinema-italian-style-2025/the-best-reward\n\nEstimated start: 16:
 30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
