DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nPresented by Create 48 Media Ne
 twork and Seattle 48 Hour Film Project Oh The Horror! The Seattle 48 Hour 
 Horror Film Project is an annual competition where filmmakers have just on
 e weekend to write\, shoot\, and edit a short horror film. The event highl
 ights Washington’s vibrant film community now in its 20th year. Teams dr
 aw a random genre and must include a specific character\, prop\, and line.
