UID:BoPmX8fp7n
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 100 mins (1h40m)\n\nSeattle Film Critics Society Pac
 ific Northwest Awards In this Portland-set dark comedy from James Sweeney 
 (2019’s crowdpleasing Straight Up)\, two men (Dylan O’Brien and Sweene
 y) trauma-bond at a support group for people who have lost their twin. Dir
 ector James Sweeney scheduled to join virtually for a post-film Q&A.\n\nht
 tps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/seattle-film-critics-society-pnw-aw
 ards-2025/twinless\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
