DESCRIPTION:Duration: 138 mins (2h18m)\n\nNow demonized as the Wicked Witc
 h of the West\, Elphaba lives in exile in the Ozian forest\, while Glinda 
 resides at the palace in Emerald City\, reveling in the perks of fame and 
 popularity. As an angry mob rises against the Wicked Witch\, she'll need t
 o reunite with Glinda to transform herself\, and all of Oz\, for good.\n\n
