DESCRIPTION:Duration: 150 mins (2h30m)\n\nPresented by Create 48 Media Ne
 twork and Seattle 48 Hour Film Project The Seattle 48 Hour Horror Film Pro
 ject is an annual competition where filmmakers have just one weekend to wr
